  "abstract": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-rjhdrqcye80000\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/97b0f7f2b381424085236993ca207846~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049939&amp;x-signature=gU%2FoKE5VtLGFFAielsqtJC4jrgs%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 874px; height: 252px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"tzwblu8f4-fy304bfdck0000\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" style=\"width: 1093px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"1093px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-1fyqzt8irgrk000\"><col data-id=\"c8gfe4ais-jieavywrvgg000\" span=\"1\" width=\"111\"><col data-id=\"c8kguwc1o-125yemuewk1c000\" span=\"1\" width=\"282\"><col data-id=\"c8ikytn5e-k2yavkfkqbk000\" span=\"1\" width=\"226\"><col data-id=\"cnkmsjzrk-14aova8fwfa8000\" span=\"1\" width=\"260\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-10ti0hlqi2q8000\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-eowdeod1kuo000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-cn7bbqy2ou0000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-wy4lr2825ds000\">操作步骤</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-ff3859igwwg000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-10b18a24wya8000\">操作详情</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-uv7hb7hmquo000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1crdfbb3zbeo000\">对应接口文档</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-9jlwkloe1lw00\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-z49yxq7mcio000\">对应平台能力</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-42lg179s0uw000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14duocf4-1fzxjink78m8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-14l786971w0w000\"><strong>Step1：上传视频素材</strong></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1b3xyljhards000\"><br></p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-fqxg5b8xye8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-j06mxhfngko000\"><strong>通过上传视频接口，将视频素材上传至账户或组织维度素材库下。</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-9xm7tkmbmkg000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-12wprwdy1eog000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710600730639\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">上传视频</a>：支持上传到投放账户（adv）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-p8cqgb0eik0000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1855448450527623\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">升级版工作台上传视频</a>：支持上传到EBP组织</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-bztic97lggo000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1801533703648324\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">异步上传视频文件</a>：支持上传到投放账户（adv）、EBP组织</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-1fm7pbihat8g000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3909sy2a1bw000\">仅支持开发者购置连山云素材服务上传生成的tos链接/连山点播云产品的视频链接上传，不支持其他三方链接地址</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1lh048g6yvds000\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1cb7gem0zo74000\"><em><strong>注意📢 若不同投放账户使用同一素材时出现重复</strong></em><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>无法上传情况</strong></em></span><em><strong>，可参考指南：</strong></em><a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/YIbawNNjDiYItpkpMX5c4h5CndZ\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><em><strong>多账户共用同一素材操作指南</strong></em></a></p></td><td data-id=\"tb5dbacrs-3n93t9pup3c000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-o32v8gpcxls00\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710600730639\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">上传视频</a></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-rq705r33nxc000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1801533703648324\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">异步上传视频文件</a></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1l4ui0a07vr4000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1855448450527623\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">升级版工作台上传视频</a></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-56iwdxm829g000\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-18pjj6s8tgbk000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1i7mddbnrzvk000\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/cf98dd28450f473e96e07364aa47eb72~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049793&amp;x-signature=ezJzxz%2B8HE84wTPSll76jrznGHg%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-v092an11b28000\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/4e5e73e54fd6451c92a5f1ec5395cf6e~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049800&amp;x-signature=oduDzgh46YuXcp88YblCWiK1EUA%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-24wqpy6jrdls00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14duocf4-ytkrzl8kc68000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-11d63tgy1b9s000\"><strong>Step2：账户间分享素材</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-18crvs5ec7fk000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-6uivmczsbpk000\"><strong>通过素材共享接口能力，将视频素材在不同账户之间进行素材分享</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-rkwb26np800000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-14coae8l54ow000\"><strong>【方式一】共享 </strong><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #b7edb1cc;\"><strong>推荐🌟</strong></span></code>：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-1ffytfxjivfk000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-yco7rlss9sw000\">通过素材共享接口能力，将素材在EBP组织间完成共享</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-14jd4pfdpgww000\">共享后EBP组织拥有素材的使用权，可用于创编投放</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-j7bfoh682mg000\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>注意📢：</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>MAPI</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>接口仅支持『组织to组织』进行组织下『</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>指定类型的</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>全部</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>素材</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>』的共享，</strong></em></span></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-64eayoexr7g000\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-cjleefq49i8000\"><em>同升级版工作台共享：支持共享给当前升级版工作台组织下其他子组织</em></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2zfcgqafeyi000\"><em>跨升级版工作台共享：仅支持通过ID共享，要求被共享的升级版工作台2与当前升级版工作台1主体一致（升级版工作台2的主体在升级版工作台1的{认证主体，授权主体}范围内）。且支持建立握手的合作升级版组织发起共享。</em></li></ul><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-hhc1h2fhvc0000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1iklmcmg7s68000\">如何开通EBP&amp;使用共享能力，详见：<a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/YIbawNNjDiYItpkpMX5c4h5CndZ#share-OoYydZ5eWo39BuxGGSOcZcebnKd\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">手册</a></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-k5i8hxovc00000\">升级版工作台的使用可查看🫱 <a href=\"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/content/145086?spaceId=377&amp;mappingType=2\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">升级版工作产品手册</a></p></blockquote><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-125tuo4hmgkw000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4okcnf9v210000\"><br></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-x69veue5tio000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-uvsr9npi80g000\"><strong>【方式二】推送 </strong><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fbbfbc;\"><strong>不推荐</strong></span></code></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-6uoyh5l3n8g000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-df0o8fzfhzs000\">通过素材推送接口能力，素材在投放账户（adv）间进行推送</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1b31am5kmpfk000\">推送后投放账户拥有素材的所有权，账户与素材建立绑定关系，可以用于创编投放</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-sbz2l89n4sw000\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>注意📢：当前推送功能容易因延迟等问题出现推送成功但素材未与被推送账户建立绑定关系情况，因此推荐使用共享能力完成素材在账户之间分享。</strong></em></span></li></ul></td><td data-id=\"tb5dbacrs-nw6zbkiuy4g000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1elcf13no6tc000\">共享：</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-16b3l44jvnq8000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4zrs49ri3r8000\"><u>获取组织下素材列表（即将上线‼️）</u></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-19gljegw6qm8000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1854120947746880\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">升级版工作台素材共享设置</a></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-6hvsdjaglxk000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1855451294366919\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">升级版工作台查询素材共享范围</a></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-qz7a6s59egg000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1855452458903624\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">升级版工作台取消素材共享</a></li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-guypce8cyp4000\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-fppdx7mcc0o000\">推送： <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710604852236\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">素材推送</a></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1fmm547bq3a8000\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-orq1wrzn6kg000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bgfasvr2cps000\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/71ad60b5fa864e1897cb0bd0830380fa~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049831&amp;x-signature=SydggWNQzh1Uty%2FOZbWULrJSaEw%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/26081068313f4e59bb9b5762256cb326~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049837&amp;x-signature=yobPiUh7%2BELzotxMyvrL1vr5xzM%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/d4fb719df5a44b19a02e1b4c88a3245c~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049842&amp;x-signature=m6w453yyVf2bBCdGTpf0KAmEo7U%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hfk81kgz8ao000\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/4fb30f44e64e490d8d3754c0efd34f74~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049846&amp;x-signature=mi5y4i5q6w9ZHIqKtBQY0FuOK8Q%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kkypf31qpts00\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-d8b2ml1k3bk000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-6bgtny48ubo000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14duocf4-169ln828azi8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-k6hy2ksy9v4000\"><strong>Step3：获取可用于创编投放使用的视频素材</strong></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-19l2lvjbjekg000\"><br></p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-1heor4csxkzk000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3t1a5uymh3q000\"><strong>获取创编可用的视频素材：</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-tnjk21tifs0000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-6zznod61qo4000\"><strong>【途径一】投放账户下素材：</strong></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-hean08z0jns000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-dgnxp0xg64o000\">获取当前adv下的视频素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-9oouhc0e4v0000\">素材范围 = 当前投放账户下素材库视频素材，即其他同主体下投放账户推送给当前投放账户的视频素材 或 通过本地上传到投放账户下的视频素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-lk135n4vs6o000\"><br></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-ioygbrxnlog000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1cq2brb0us80000\"><strong>【途径二】投放账户可用的组织共享素材：</strong></li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-vr8sio2xqi8000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1hi9wu8uoujk000\">获取adv所属组织下视频素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-y8xqr1lio0g000\">素材范围为 <u>被共享到当前adv 或 被共享到当前直属组织的视频素材 或 被共享到当前adv所属主体的视频素材</u></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-l3eehvox6ds000\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>注意📢：adv无法通过</strong></em></span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847847898159115?origin=left_nav\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>获取账户可用的组织视频列表</strong></em></span></a><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><em><strong>接口获取</strong></em></span><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><u><em><strong>没被共享过来的素材</strong></em></u></span></li></ul></td><td data-id=\"tb5dbacrs-wx454wmc8ps000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-oj11bfyk5gw000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1696710601820172\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取视频素材</a></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-tsy1za2malc000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847847898159115?origin=left_nav\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取账户可用的组织视频列表</a></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-12itv2q10c00000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-108u809aq4q8000\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/04dde12366834dacb5d66c06ab8efb33~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049869&amp;x-signature=NIfkTmmhjpv8Ssmt8vFqUsZ7dQI%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dollr25vzyo000\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/6202e127de7e4ad4aa53ae748408538a~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2100049873&amp;x-signature=YDnqeqDEyrP4FScJw70t%2FP6YJT8%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-h3uk9050n2w000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1lk633u9u2xs000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t346gfaqe-d4v8gwzf0ko000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top;